      "name": "AV1 解码",
      "description": "提供 AV1 解码器接口，支持 Annex-B/OBU、外部帧缓冲、低比特深度路径、多线程解码等。",
      "evidence": ["aom/aom_decoder.h", "av1/av1_dx_iface.c", "apps/aomdec.c", "av1/decoder/"]
    },
    {
      "name": "容器与示例工具",
      "description": "提供 IVF/WebM 容器读写、Y4M 输入解析、统计输出，以及 aomenc/aomdec 命令行工具和多个示例程序。",
      "evidence": ["common/ivfenc.c", "common/ivfdec.c", "common/webmdec.cc", "common/webmenc.cc", "apps/aomenc.c", "apps/aomdec.c"]
